{"author":{"id":"8022379585b4ab99ca8775db3eb67d33fcb256817114c28e51ccc1e9f55cdec4"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1789849540,"nonce":"P357g3S+cmK035zS9TSecZ+iPV8=","title":"`var x = null` and `var x;` stayed Dynamic after a typed assignment","message":"Haxe binds such a local's monomorph at its first assignment; the typer left it Dynamic, so `var aname = null; aname = str.substr(...); xml.exists(aname)` unboxed a raw string pointer as a Dynamic box (haxe.xml.Parser faulted on every element with an attribute). The first plain assignment now types the local: the assigned type, or `Null\u003cT\u003e` for a scalar.","files":null}]}